WEBVTT

00:11:58.564 --> 00:12:02.500
which we perceive as sad.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:05.769
But what's the actual difference between these two chords?

00:12:05.769 --> 00:12:08.006
It's just these two notes in the middle.

00:12:08.006 --> 00:12:10.971
It's either E natural,

00:12:10.971 --> 00:12:15.671
and 659 vibrations per second,

00:12:15.687 --> 00:12:20.375
or E flat, at 622.

00:12:20.375 --> 00:12:26.000
So the big difference between human happiness and sadness?

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:28.750
37 freakin' vibrations.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:32.667
So you can see in a system like this